<title>USA: Immunogen, Biochem announce collaboration.</title>
<headline>Immunogen, Biochem announce collaboration.</headline>
<dateline>CAMBRIDGE, Mass. 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>ImmunoGen Inc and BioChem Pharma  Inc said Friday they will collaborate for the discovery and development  of anti-cancer therapeutics.</p>
<p>The companies said the collaboration is between ImmunoGen's 95 percent-owned  subsidiary, Apoptosis Technology, Inc and BioChem.</p>
<p>ImmuGen said the agreement includes a &quot;significant infusion of cash&quot;  into its Apoptosis Technology unit. It declined to disclose financial  details of the agreement.</p>
</text>
